{"text": "Professor Louis D. Quin\nDepartment of Chemistry\nDuke University\nDurham, North Carolina\n\nDear Dr. Quin:\n\nSeptember 7, 1961\n\nIhave made an appointment with President Deryl Hart for 10 o'clock\non the morning of Wednesday, September 20, for a brief formal\npresentation of the grant to Duke University for a Philip Morris\nAssistantsiip in Chemistry. I would be very pleased to have you\nand Dr. Saylor be present at the time. In fact, Iam suggesting\nthat possibly Mr. Robert W. Norris, our Public Relations\nDirector, and I call at your office around 9 that morning, if con-\nvenient with you, to meet you and to visit the Chemistry Department.\nIf this time is not suitable, perhaps we could come over after the\n\npresentation.\n\nWe look forward to meeting you and your colleagues.\n\nHv:br\nce: Dr. Dery) Hart\nDr. J. H. Saylor\n\nMr. R. W. Norris\n\nVery sincerely yours,\nPHILIP MORRIS INCORPCRATED\n\nHelmut Wakeham, Vice President and\nDirector of Research & Development\n\n\u00bb\ni]\n\u00b0\n2\n@\nn\na\n@\n\u00a9.\na", "words": [{"text": "Professor", "x0": 132, "y0": 353, "x1": 209, "y1": 367, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "Louis", "x0": 215, "y0": 354, "x1": 257, "y1": 367, "conf": 31.0}, {"text": "D.", "x0": 263, "y0": 355, "x1": 280, "y1": 367, "conf": 92.0}, {"text": "Quin", "x0": 288, "y0": 354, "x1": 322, "y1": 369, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Department", "x0": 131, "y0": 372, "x1": 221, "y1": 387, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "of", "x0": 226, "y0": 372, "x1": 241, "y1": 385, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Chemistry", "x0": 246, "y0": 372, "x1": 325, "y1": 388, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Duke", "x0": 132, "y0": 389, "x1": 169, "y1": 402, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "University", "x0": 175, "y0": 390, "x1": 254, "y1": 405, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Durham,", "x0": 132, "y0": 407, "x1": 197, "y1": 422, "conf": 85.0}, {"text": "North", "x0": 206, "y0": 408, "x1": 249, "y1": 420, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Carolina", "x0": 254, "y0": 408, "x1": 320, "y1": 420, "conf": 95.0}, {"t